{"t":"NEE","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"NextEra Energy, Inc.","ko":"넥스트에라","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":17400,"hq":"Juno Beach, FL, United States","website":"https://www.nexteraenergy.com","summary_en":"NextEra Energy, Inc., through its subsidiaries, generates, stores, transmits, distributes, and sells electric power to retail and wholesale customers in North America. It operates through Florida Power & Light Company (FPL) and NEER segments. The company generates electricity from wind, solar, nuclear, natural gas, and other clean energy assets. It also invests in generation, storage, transmission, and distribution facilities; owns, develops, constructs, manages, and operates generation facilities, including renewables, nuclear and natural gas, and battery storage facilities in the wholesale energy market in the United States and Canada, as well as electric and gas transmission assets, and natural gas pipelines; provides full energy and capacity requirement services; markets and trades in energy-related commodities; and participates in the production of natural gas, natural gas liquids, and oil. As of December 31, 2025, the company had approximately 35,963 megawatts of net generating capacity; approximately 93,000 circuit miles of transmission and distribution lines; and 932 substations. It serves approximately 12 million people through approximately 6 million customer accounts on the east and lower west coasts of Florida. The company was formerly known as FPL Group, Inc. and changed its name to NextEra Energy, Inc. in 2010. NextEra Energy, Inc. was founded in 1925 and is headquartered in Juno Beach, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"NextEra Energy, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 북미 지역의 소매 및 도매 고객에게 전력을 생성, 저장, 전송, 분배 및 판매합니다. FPL(Florida Power & Light Company) 및 NEER 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 풍력, 태양광, 원자력, 천연가스 및 기타 청정 에너지 자산을 통해 전기를 생산합니다. 또한 발전, 저장, 송전 및 배전 시설에도 투자합니다. 미국과 캐나다 도매 에너지 시장의 재생 에너지, 핵 및 천연 가스, 배터리 저장 시설을 포함한 발전 시설과 전기 및 가스 송전 자산, 천연 가스 파이프라인을 소유, 개발, 건설, 관리 및 운영합니다. 전체 에너지 및 용량 요구 사항 서비스를 제공합니다. 에너지 관련 상품의 시장 및 거래; 천연가스, 천연가스 액체, 석유 생산에 참여합니다. 2025년 12월 31일 현재 회사의 순 발전 용량은 약 35,963MW입니다. 약 93,000 회로 마일의 전송 및 배전선; 그리고 932개의 변전소. 플로리다 동부 및 서부 해안 지역의 약 600만 개 고객 계정을 통해 약 1,200만 명에게 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 FPL Group, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2010년에 NextEra Energy, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. NextEra Energy, Inc.는 1925년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 주노 비치에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":86.86,"mcap":182172008448.0,"pe":15.65045,"fpe":19.85249,"peg":1.7738,"ps":6.319931,"pb":2.9622808,"ev_ebitda":22.652,"div":2.87,"beta":0.6,"hi52":98.75,"lo52":74.41},"fin":{"rev":28824999936.0,"rev_g":0.016,"eps_g":0.932,"gross":0.60173,"op":0.33004,"net":0.40370998,"roe":0.14064,"fcf":-21211250688.0,"cash":5578999808.0,"debt":113932001280.0,"de":153.254,"eps":5.55,"feps":4.37527},"own":{"short":0.0,"inst":0.8668,"insider":0.00116},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":94.0,"median":99.0,"high":110.0,"low":56.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.90909,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":79.0,"priorPriceTarget":84.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-21","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":108.0,"priorPriceTarget":108.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-20","Firm":"BMO Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":88.0,"priorPriceTarget":93.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-19","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-W